92b91a2","term":"앨범","zh":"专辑","audio":"/audio/6f34dac7c92b91a25a59.mp3","entryId":"14284","definition":"把多首歌曲或演奏曲目等装在一张光盘或磁带等的东西。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"5f104909fa8ff0fa","term":"팔리다","zh":"被卖掉，被卖出","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3","entryId":"71483","definition":"收取钱财后，物品或权利被交给对方或劳动力等被提供。","pronunciation":["팔리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c4b5e428a4583c5b0e1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14284-2-7-2","ko":"응, 생각보다는 잘 팔리는 것 같아.","zh":"嗯，看起来比预期的还要好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"생각보다는","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；보다：比较的基准：“比……”；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다는","audio":"/audio/aae26f17c3d9a1e38f75.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"팔리는","meaning":"被卖掉，被卖出","explanation":"팔리다：被卖掉，被卖出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"팔리다","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71483","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔리다","origin":"NIKL Ko